  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "One side of aluminum foil is shiny and the",
      "start": 0.071,
      "end": 1.803
    },
    {
      "text": "other side is dull,",
      "start": 1.874,
      "end": 2.679
    },
    {
      "text": "and the box never explains why.",
      "start": 2.907,
      "end": 4.336
    },
    {
      "text": "It is not a coating,",
      "start": 4.62,
      "end": 5.422
    },
    {
      "text": "and it is not a nonstick side.",
      "start": 5.615,
      "end": 7.115
    },
    {
      "text": "Foil gets rolled thinner and thinner between",
      "start": 7.492,
      "end": 9.51
    },
    {
      "text": "polished steel rollers,",
      "start": 9.581,
      "end": 10.564
    },
    {
      "text": "and by the last pass it is so thin",
      "start": 10.903,
      "end": 12.528
    },
    {
      "text": "a single sheet would tear itself apart,",
      "start": 12.832,
      "end": 14.439
    },
    {
      "text": "so the mill runs two sheets through stacked",
      "start": 14.691,
      "end": 16.441
    },
    {
      "text": "together.",
      "start": 16.476,
      "end": 16.968
    },
    {
      "text": "The outer faces press against mirror-bright",
      "start": 17.12,
      "end": 18.995
    },
    {
      "text": "steel",
      "start": 19.067,
      "end": 19.475
    },
    {
      "text": "and come out shiny.",
      "start": 19.589,
      "end": 20.428
    },
    {
      "text": "The two inner faces press against each other",
      "start": 20.722,
      "end": 22.545
    },
    {
      "text": "and come out dull.",
      "start": 22.776,
      "end": 23.526
    }
  ],
